! The Master's Book

''Genre:'' wuxia primer — original pedagogical microfiction.  
''Grammar:'' [[Grammar/SVO Word Order]], [[Grammar/Classifiers]].

!! Text (try reading without the gloss)

<div class="mandarin-hanzi">师父有一本书。</div>
<div class="mandarin-hanzi">弟子喜欢这本书。</div>
<div class="mandarin-hanzi">师父教弟子剑法。</div>
<div class="mandarin-hanzi">弟子学剑法。</div>

<details><summary>Reveal pinyin and translation</summary>

|!Hanzi|!Pinyin|!English|
|师父有一本书。|Shīfu yǒu yì běn shū.|The master has a book.|
|弟子喜欢这本书。|Dìzǐ xǐhuan zhè běn shū.|The disciple likes this book.|
|师父教弟子剑法。|Shīfu jiāo dìzǐ jiànfǎ.|The master teaches the disciple sword techniques.|
|弟子学剑法。|Dìzǐ xué jiànfǎ.|The disciple studies sword techniques.|

</details>

!! Interpret the structure
* 一本书 (yì běn shū): number + classifier + noun
* 这本书 (zhè běn shū): demonstrative + classifier + noun
* 教弟子剑法 (jiāo dìzǐ jiànfǎ): teach + learner + material

